      "created_at": "2015-01-11T01:05:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Interesting. Based on the \"cards are in play for their destruction effects\" ruling <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/comment/61044#forum-topic-top\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">here</a>, I would have expected the opposite.</p><p>Unless, of course, cards are destroyed before they take the damage that destroys them. Then it all makes sense. ;D</p>",
