      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-01-11T01:49:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It works like any other target, say Citizen Hammer come into play and tried to blast everyone for 3 fire damage, AZ has Transducer and deals him 3 cold, he drops to 0hp and leaves play, no more damage is dealt by him.</p><p>Cryo and Captain's Constructs work the same way, the effect wants to trigger but because they are at 0hp they leave play and the effect ends, this time before actually doing anything.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If the text says \"When this card is destroyed. . .\" then it stays in play while that effect resolves, then continues the destruction process.</p>",
