      "username": "Cosmonaut_Zero",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/cosmonaut_zero/{size}/2520_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-01-11T06:45:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>What I'm not understanding is how the same set of basic principles could possibly produce both the Cryo Bot ruling and the Mountainous Carapace ruling.</p><p><span>Is it just the case that effects triggered by destruction are an exception to the basic principles, or is there some explanation that works for both that I'm missing?</span></p>",
