      "raw": "<p>What I&#39;m not understanding is how the same set of basic principles could possibly produce both the Cryo Bot ruling and the Mountainous Carapace ruling.</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Is it just the case that effects triggered by destruction are an exception to the basic principles, or is there some explanation that works for both that I&#39;m missing?</span></p>",
