      "raw": "<p>Because generally, destroying something immediately ends any effects they had in play; cards with an effect that specifically says &quot;when this card is destroyed,&quot; however -- such as any of Akash&#39;Bhuta&#39;s limbs, the explosives wagon, etc. -- are a special exception. They remain in play to resolve their effect, but only because they must act after they are destroyed.</p>",
