      "raw": "[quote=\"phantaskippy\"]\n\n3. &nbsp;If destruction is not prevented and after any on destruct text from the card itself is resolved it leaves play, enters the trash and counts as destroyed for &quot;when ___ is destroyed&quot; text on other cards.&nbsp;I believe this is the proper order.\n\n[/quote]\n\nGiven your claims (and subsequent discussion) <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/comment/93918#comment-93918\">here</a>, I would modify that slightly.\n\n3. &nbsp;If destruction is not prevented and after any on destruct text from the card itself is resolved it leaves play, then...\n\n3a. All destruction triggers *not* on the destroyed card happen.&nbsp; (I *think* this includes triggers on &quot;leaving play&quot;, but am less sure about that.)\n\n3b. Destroyed card goes to trash (unless it already went somewhere else due to 3a).\n",
